//Gets 3 inputs
Input
Store X
Input
Store Y
Input
Store Z


//checks X with Y
Load X
Subt Y
SkipCond 000
Jump YSmaller //Y is smaller
//X is Smaller and check with Z
Load X
Subt Z
SkipCond 000
Jump ZXY//output is ZXY
//X is Smaller than Z, so we check Y and Z for second/third output
Load Y
Subt Z
Skipcond 000
Jump XZY//output XZY
//output is XYZ
load X
Output
Load Y
Output
Load Z
Output
Jump End//end


//check Y and Z knowing X is bigger than Y
YSmaller, Load Y
Subt Z
SkipCond 000
Jump ZYX//output ZYX
//check X and Z knowing Y is smallest
Load X
Subt Z
SkipCond 000
Jump YZX //Output YZX
//output YXZ
Load Y
Output
Load X
Output
Load Z
Output
Jump End//end


ZXY, Load Z
Output
Load X
Output
Load Y
Output
Jump End//end


XZY, Load X
Output
Load Z
Output
Load Y
Output
Jump End


ZYX, Load Z
Output
Load Y
Output
Load X
Output
Jump End


YZX, Load Y
Output
Load Z
Output
Load X
Output
Jump End


End, Halt
// Memory variables
X, DEC 0
Y, DEC 0
Z, DEC 0